#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.5.0"
msgstr "v2.5.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.5.0 is a feature-rich imaging release: it adds ``find_rects()``, "
"``find_circles()``, ``get_regression()`` (line/regression fitting), "
"``find_number()`` (LeNet digits), the ``ImageWriter`` / ``ImageReader`` "
"stream classes, :func:`sensor.flush` / ``width()`` / ``height()``, and "
":class:`pyb.RTC` support. Image loading is now framebuffer-backed — read the"
" breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v2.5.0 是一個功能豐富的影像處理版本：它新增了 ``find_rects()``\\ 、\\ ``find_circles()``\\ 、\\ "
"``get_regression()``\\ （直線／迴歸擬合）、\\ ``find_number()``\\ （LeNet 數字）、\\ "
"``ImageWriter`` / ``ImageReader`` 串流類別、\\ :func:`sensor.flush` / ``width()``"
" / ``height()``\\ ，以及 :class:`pyb.RTC` 支援。影像載入現在以 framebuffer 為基礎 — "
"請閱讀下方的破壞性變更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:16
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本頁內容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "重點摘要"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:21
msgid "``image.find_rects()`` — rectangle / quad detector with corner output."
msgstr "``image.find_rects()`` — 矩形／四邊形偵測器，帶有角點輸出。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:22
msgid "``image.find_circles()`` — Hough circle detection."
msgstr "``image.find_circles()`` — Hough 圓形偵測。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:23
msgid ""
"``image.get_regression()`` — least-squares and robust (Theil-Sen) line "
"fitting."
msgstr "``image.get_regression()`` — 最小平方法與穩健（Theil-Sen）直線擬合。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:25
msgid "``image.find_number()`` — LeNet digit recognition."
msgstr "``image.find_number()`` — LeNet 數字辨識。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:26
msgid ""
"``ImageWriter`` / ``ImageReader`` — record and play back image streams."
msgstr "``ImageWriter`` / ``ImageReader`` — 錄製與播放影像串流。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:27
msgid ""
":class:`pyb.RTC` support, plus :func:`sensor.flush` / :func:`sensor.width` /"
" :func:`sensor.height`."
msgstr ""
":class:`pyb.RTC` 支援，以及 :func:`sensor.flush` / :func:`sensor.width` / "
":func:`sensor.height`\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** image loading is now framebuffer-backed and raises if the "
"image is too large — see the breaking changes."
msgstr "**破壞性變更：** 影像載入現在以 framebuffer 為基礎，若影像過大則會引發例外 — 請參閱破壞性變更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:33
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Feature detection** — added ``image.find_rects()`` (AprilTag quad "
"detector; rect objects with ``x`` / ``y`` / ``w`` / ``h`` / ``corners`` / "
"``magnitude``), ``image.find_circles()`` (Hough), ``image.get_regression()``"
" (least-squares + Theil-Sen robust line fitting), and "
"``image.find_number()`` (LeNet digit recognition), each with example "
"scripts."
msgstr ""
"**特徵偵測** — 新增 ``image.find_rects()``\\ （AprilTag 四邊形偵測器；rect 物件帶有 ``x`` / "
"``y`` / ``w`` / ``h`` / ``corners`` / ``magnitude``\\ ）、\\ "
"``image.find_circles()``\\ （Hough）、\\ ``image.get_regression()``\\ （最小平方法 + "
"Theil-Sen 穩健直線擬合）以及 ``image.find_number()``\\ （LeNet 數字辨識），每項皆附帶範例指令碼。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Result corners** — added a ``corners`` attribute to the QR-code / AprilTag"
" / data-matrix / barcode result objects."
msgstr ""
"**結果角點** — 為 QR-code / AprilTag / data-matrix / 條碼結果物件新增了 ``corners`` 屬性。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Image streams** — added the ``image.ImageWriter`` / ``image.ImageReader`` "
"classes (16-byte-aligned chunk format) with ``image_writer.py`` / "
"``image_reader.py`` examples."
msgstr ""
"**影像串流** — 新增了 ``image.ImageWriter`` / ``image.ImageReader`` 類別（16 "
"位元組對齊的區塊格式），並附帶 ``image_writer.py`` / ``image_reader.py`` 範例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Sensor** — added :func:`sensor.flush` (push the framebuffer to the IDE "
"without a snapshot) and :func:`sensor.width` / :func:`sensor.height`."
msgstr ""
"**感測器** — 新增 :func:`sensor.flush`\\ （不進行快照即將 framebuffer 推送至 IDE）以及 "
":func:`sensor.width` / :func:`sensor.height`\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:47
msgid ":class:`pyb.RTC` — enabled RTC support with an ``rtc.py`` example."
msgstr ":class:`pyb.RTC` — 啟用 RTC 支援，並附帶 ``rtc.py`` 範例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:48
msgid ""
"Added a cat-face Haar cascade and a Servo-Shield (PCA9685) example; the "
"``openmv-cascade.py`` host tool gained support for the new OpenCV XML "
"cascade format."
msgstr ""
"新增了一個貓臉 Haar 級聯與一個 Servo-Shield（PCA9685）範例；\\ ``openmv-cascade.py`` "
"主機端工具新增了對新版 OpenCV XML 級聯格式的支援。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:53
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他變更與改進"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:55
msgid ""
"The framebuffer was refactored so ``copy_to_fb`` image methods update the "
"IDE preview; ``HaarCascade()`` paths no longer require a leading ``/`` "
"(built-in vs. file is auto-detected); GIF/MJPEG recording now supports VGA "
"(and BAYER GIFs); the built-in ``README.txt`` was updated and the "
"``openmv.inf`` driver file is no longer created on a fresh filesystem."
msgstr ""
"framebuffer 經過重構，使 ``copy_to_fb`` 影像方法會更新 IDE 預覽；\\ ``HaarCascade()`` "
"路徑不再需要前置 ``/``\\ （內建與檔案會自動偵測）；GIF/MJPEG 錄製現在支援 VGA（以及 BAYER GIF）；更新了內建的 "
"``README.txt``\\ ，且全新檔案系統上不再建立 ``openmv.inf`` 驅動程式檔案。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:62
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "錯誤修正"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:64
msgid "Imaging:"
msgstr "影像處理："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:66
msgid ""
"Fixed ``find_circles()`` vote accumulation, ``get_regression()`` rho offset "
"with an ROI and a memory leak, ``find_lines()`` segment merging, "
"``find_blobs()`` angle averaging and default (least-restrictive) color "
"bounds, ORB keypoint sort stability / descriptor ordering and the matched-"
"flag, and Haar cascade buffered loading (unaligned reads)."
msgstr ""
"修正了 ``find_circles()`` 的投票累加、\\ ``get_regression()`` 在使用 ROI 時的 rho "
"偏移與記憶體洩漏、\\ ``find_lines()`` 的線段合併、\\ ``find_blobs()`` "
"的角度平均與預設（限制最少）色彩邊界、ORB 關鍵點排序穩定性／描述子排序與 matched 旗標，以及 Haar 級聯的緩衝載入（非對齊讀取）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:72
msgid "System:"
msgstr "系統："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:74
msgid ""
"Enabled :mod:`pyb` Servo 3 (P9) (#256), fixed the RTC init, increased the "
"UART character timeout (#240), and fixed the uninitialized sensor "
"framebuffer \"enabled\" flag."
msgstr ""
"啟用了 :mod:`pyb` Servo 3（P9）（#256）、修正了 RTC 初始化、增加了 UART "
"字元逾時（#240），並修正了未初始化的感測器 framebuffer 「enabled」旗標。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:79
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "硬體與開發板支援"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:81
msgid ""
":class:`pyb.RTC` support and :mod:`pyb` Servo 3 (P9); Servo-Shield (PCA9685)"
" example."
msgstr ":class:`pyb.RTC` 支援與 :mod:`pyb` Servo 3（P9）；Servo-Shield（PCA9685）範例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:85
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "破壞性 API 變更"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:87
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v2.4.1 and v2.5.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"v2.4.1 與 v2.5.0 之間使用者可見的 API 破壞性變更。範圍：\\ ``modules/`` 中的 Python C 模組與 "
"``scripts/libraries/`` 中的 Python 函式庫。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:90
msgid ""
"The breaking change is a *behavior* change (same API, different result) — "
"re-check affected scripts. Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"此破壞性變更是一項 *behavior*\\ （行為）變更（API 相同，結果不同）— 請重新檢查受影響的指令碼。每個 commit hash "
"都連結至其在 GitHub 上的 diff。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:96
msgid "Image loading is framebuffer-backed *(behavior)*"
msgstr "影像載入以 framebuffer 為基礎 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:98
msgid ""
":class:`image.Image` / image loading now copies the loaded image into the "
"main framebuffer and raises an exception if the image is too large to fit. "
"Loads that previously succeeded into a heap buffer may now fail — ensure "
"loaded images fit the framebuffer (or handle the new error)."
msgstr ""
":class:`image.Image` / 影像載入現在會將載入的影像複製到主 framebuffer "
"中，若影像太大而無法容納則會引發例外。先前可成功載入至堆積緩衝區的載入操作現在可能會失敗 — 請確保載入的影像能容納於 framebuffer "
"中（或處理新的錯誤）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:103
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `87d53385a <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/87d53385a>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `87d53385a <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/87d53385a>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:108
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "遷移檢查清單"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.5.0.rst:110
msgid ""
"Ensure loaded images fit the framebuffer (or catch the new \"image too "
"large\" error) where you previously relied on heap-backed image loads "
"(:ref:`the image-load change <v2_5_0_imageload>`). All other scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"在您先前依賴堆積緩衝區進行影像載入的地方，請確保載入的影像能容納於 framebuffer 中（或捕捉新的「影像太大」錯誤）（\\ "
":ref:`影像載入變更 <v2_5_0_imageload>`\\ ）。其餘所有指令碼皆可不經修改直接執行。"
